* and the proposed degradation pathway — mystic seals → black/white circles → chakra anatomy → Taoist sexual ritual → invariant dot placeholder copied perfectly in all witnesses while meaning is lost — has no manuscript evidence.

A–G, and a de-personalised institutional reading of C, stay within the known world of Tokugawa manuscript control, esoteric pedagogy and transmission loss. H alone demands simultaneous importation of Indian chakras, Taoist sexual alchemy and a modern anatomical mapping projected back onto 1676, and then an improbable uniform loss of meaning. That makes it the least historically grounded explanation for why every surviving transcription shows the same systematic blank in the same place.

