Core pro-H holdouts 13,14,7:
Objections to C are nominal specificity not mechanism. State secrecy, gendered censorship and lineage protection are documented Tokugawa practices and underwrite A,B,D. If ‘Lady Saigō = Hattori stepdaughter’ is a later gloss/conflation, the explanatory class remains historically intelligible. H is different: it requires stacked anachronistic syncretism — Kuji-in/kujiho conflated with Indian chakras, “nine holes of the female body”, Taoist hui/erotic energy flow, yin-yang mind-influence ritual — with no Edo documentary anchor. Bansenshukai treats Kuji-in as Shingon/Onmyōdō mystic seals and frames Kunoichi no Jutsu in conventional espionage terms, not occult sexual alchemy. “Nine holes” is modern fetish slang, not Edo technical vocabulary. Explanation is modern new-age projection with zero manuscript evidence for symbolic degradation to fixed ⬤○ pattern.

